    <surveyls_description><![CDATA[We would like your opinion on a new idea. The survey takes about 6 minutes.]]></surveyls_description>
    <surveyls_welcometext><![CDATA[You are about to see a description of a new product. Please read it and answer a few questions.]]></surveyls_welcometext>
